  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">김신혜 선생님</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">동영상에서 미리 수업내용을 다 일러주는 게 아닌 다른 방법도 생각해봐야겠어요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이 방법이 적당하지 않은 부분도 있으니</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">수업내용을 다 설명해준다면 </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">--&gt; </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">아이들이 학교에 오지 않아도 될 것 같습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">집에서 동영상 보고 공부하면 되니</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">... ㅋㅋ</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">동영상의 성격은</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><STRONG>1. 개념에 대한 명확한 이해를 돕는 동영상</STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;과학은 개념을 많이 필요로 합니다.&nbsp;</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;개념에 대한 이해를 어려워하구요.</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;동영상을 통해 이해하기 쉽고 명확한 개념을 전달할 수 있습니다. </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (여러번 시청할 수 있구요. 수업시간에는 해당 내용을 개인적으로 다시 질문을 할 수 있구요.)</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;그렇다면 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;교사는 아래의 <STRONG>고민</STRONG>을 해야 합니다.</SPAN></P><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 1) 어떻게 하면 강의식 수업을 잘 할 수 있을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 2) 어떻게 하면 어려운 내용을 쉽게 설명할 수 있을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 3) 동영상의 집중력을 높이는 방법 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예능 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">TV를</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;참고해야 할 듯^^</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 4) 글씨를 쓸 때 보다 쉽게 쓸 수 있는 소프트웨어가 있을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; '<SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">갤럭시 노트</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2'의 메모 기능을&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이용하여 동영상을 만들면 어떨까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? </SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다른 스마트폰에서도 공유가 가능한가?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P></SPAN></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><STRONG>2. 차시 학습을 위한 오리엔테이션 동영상</STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 동영상은 설명이 아닌 다음 시간 수업을 위한 탐구문제제시, 힌트 등을 담으면 어떨까요?</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG>3. 또 어떤 성격의 동영상이 적합할까요?</STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
